    parametrosConstantesEtiqueta: "(no variation in this run)",
    repeticionesEsperadasEtiqueta: "Expected repetitions per combination: 6 (flagged in the row only when it falls short).",
    resultadoNoFiableMarcador: "N/A *",
    avisoResultadoNoFiable: (n) => `* Unreliable result: ${n} of this duration's repetitions produced a drop so extreme (below -60%) that it's more likely due to an internal error not yet resolved than to a real portfolio loss. They've been excluded from the average and the range — no number is shown in their place, so as not to give a figure that looks real but isn't.`,
    avisoResultadoNoFiableCorto: (n) => `${n} repetition(s) excluded: drop so extreme it's probably an unresolved internal error, not a real loss.`,
    indiceSeleccionadoEtiqueta: "Index to analyze:",
    sesionesPuntuacionEtiqueta: "Sessions averaged:",
    diasEfectivosAviso: (dias) => `With these settings, the window only produces ${dias} days of real selection (backtest window minus sessions averaged). That may be too little to draw conclusions from — consider widening the window or lowering the sessions averaged.`,
    diasEfectivosBloqueo: (diasVentana, sesionesPuntuacion) => `The backtest window (${diasVentana} sessions) is smaller than or equal to the sessions averaged (${sesionesPuntuacion}): no real selection days would be left. Widen the window or lower the sessions averaged before continuing.`,

